From: =?utf-8?b?T25kxZllaiBTdXLDvQ==?= <ondrej@sury.org>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:46:11 +0100
Subject: Adjust the tidy tests to tidy-html5

The tidy extension is built with the system libtidy, which is tidy-html5:
it writes the HTML5 doctype, words its report differently, has other ids
for the tags and no "language" option. Backport of the upstream commits
that PHP 5.6 never got: 0e3e132a8af, 08b10f17f17, 846c72a3b8f,
a467a42dd17, 6319a358496 (PHP 7.1.0) and 83a77383b92 (PHP 7.1.14).
